                                            "imageName":  "BaruukCalmingWave.png"
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "name":  "Desolate Hands",
                                            "description":  "Summon a bevy of orbiting daggers to seek out enemy guns, destroying them with a small explosion. Combine with Elude to double the range.",
